+# Editor12: project activation plugin work occurs after Runtime04 publication
+
+## 来源执行者
+
+- 来源计划：`docs/plans/zircon_editor/editor/10-project-and-asset-reference-management.md`
+- 来源执行切片：M1 prepared project activation / pre-commit Editor install artifact.
+- 修复责任计划：`docs/plans/zircon_editor/editor/12-plugin-management.md`
+- 交接原因：project-native discovery、manifest completion、registration report publication and plugin-manager application are owned by Editor12; Editor10 only supplies the staged project generation and immutable manifest projection.
+
+## 失败现象与复现证据
+
+`EditorManager::open_project` first calls `host.open_project`, which commits Runtime04 and builds the document/catalog/watcher surface. Only afterwards it calls `apply_project_plugin_manifest_or_close`.
+
+That function performs native plugin discovery from `<project>/zircon_plugins`, computes the completed project plugin manifest, publishes native registration reports, applies the manager manifest, and publishes status. Any failure calls `host.close_project` as a surrogate rollback.
+
+Closing the newly committed project cannot restore the predecessor Runtime04 generation, prior editor asset projection, watcher, document, or previous plugin snapshot. The failure therefore creates a visible half-activation even though the plugin precondition failed.
+
+## 最低共享层根因
+
+Editor12 exposes discovery/completion only through `EditorManager` methods that mix fallible filesystem work with active plugin-manager mutation. It has no move-only prepared project-plugin capability and no infallible install transition that can join Editor10's latest-ready activation gate.
+
+## 架构修复验收
+
+- Prepare native discovery, completed `ProjectManifest`, registration reports, and status from the immutable staged manifest/root before Runtime04 commit; preparation must not mutate active plugin state.
+- Return a move-only prepared plugin activation that the same latest-ready token owns with catalog, watcher, document, and session preparations.
+- Make the final plugin install one serialized, in-memory, no-failure replacement, or validate all failure conditions before Runtime04 commit and preserve the previous plugin projection on rejection.
+- Prove discovery, manifest-completion, registration, and plugin-manager rejection each leave the prior Runtime04 and plugin projections unchanged; prove a successful install occurs once.
+
+## 禁止临时方案
+
+- Do not call `close_project`, clear active plugins, or best-effort unregister as rollback after a failed project plugin action.
+- Do not rediscover `<project>/zircon_plugins` from a retained-host install callback or reintroduce a root extractor on `ProjectActivation`.
+- Do not leave native reports published before manifest validation, or add a compatibility path that applies plugins outside the ready-token transaction.
+
+## 修复结果与回传
+
+Open state: `待 Editor12 建立 project-plugin preflight/install transaction；Editor10 不得以 close_project 伪回滚。`
